  <p class="small crumb"><a href="/">Svapna</a> · <a href="/stars">The sky</a> · The history</p>
  <h1>Four thousand years, <em>in order.</em></h1>
  <p class="lede">Astrology began as a service to kings, became a science taught in universities, lost that standing in the seventeenth century, and returned in the twentieth as something to read over breakfast. This is the sequence for the tradition that runs from Babylon through Greece to Europe, India and the Islamic world. China and the Americas built their own systems, described under <a href="/stars/traditions">Around the world</a>.</p>
  <StarsNav path="/stars/history" />

  <div class="steps">
    {T.map(([when, what, text]) => <div><b>{when}</b><div><p><strong>{what}.</strong> {text}</p></div></div>)}
